flowchart TD
    A[User Preferences<br/>genre, mood, energy<br/>optional: tempo, valence]
    B[Load songs from CSV<br/>into list of song records]
    C{{For each song<br/>in songs list}}
    D[Compute score_song(song, prefs)<br/>genre points + mood points<br/>+ energy similarity<br/>+ optional tempo/valence]
    E[Store result:<br/>(song, base_score, reasons)]
    F{More songs left?}
    G[Sort all songs by<br/>base_score descending]
    H{{Build Top K recommendations<br/>with diversity-aware selection}}
    I[For each remaining candidate:<br/>adjusted_score = base_score<br/>- artist repeat penalty<br/>- genre repeat penalty]
    J[Pick highest adjusted_score<br/>Add to selected list]
    K{Selected K songs?}
    L[Output ranked Top K list<br/>with score + explanation]

    A --> D
    B --> C
    C --> D
    D --> E
    E --> F
    F -- Yes --> C
    F -- No --> G
    G --> H
    H --> I
    I --> J
    J --> K
    K -- No --> H
    K -- Yes --> L
